0 FILE 21011 - Brandenburg Gate.ldr
0 A wide architectural model of the Brandenburg Gate featuring a dark bluish grey base, tan Doric columns built from spindled fences and plates, and light bluish grey upper structure topped with ornamental details and a labeled tile.
0 Name: 21011 - Brandenburg Gate.ldr
0 Author: Orion Pobursky [OrionP]
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under CCAL version 2.0 : see CAreadme.txt

